{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50619","headline":"暇日题草堂 · 钱起","name":"暇日题草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲郎过壮岁，晚景对秋天。\n门掩苍苔上，池清寒竹前。\n通经未拾紫，炼药不成仙。\n且醖东臯黍，愁来得醉眠。\n（见宋赵师秀编选《唐衆妙集》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}